# Agent Hard Constraints

- Never commit local private notes or transcript files.
- Keep changes scoped to the user request; avoid unrelated refactors.
- Before completion, verify changed files and summarize follow-up actions.
- Do not claim completion without checking impacted files for consistency.
- For multi-file work, prefer incremental commits with clear intent.
- Do not commit local `vendor/` upstream snapshots or generated `build/` artifacts unless explicitly requested.
